# Android signing. The keystore itself lives OUTSIDE this repo, at
# C:\Users\evank\.scanified-signing\upload-key.jks, so that an accidental
# `git add -A` cannot reach it. credentials.json holds the three passwords
# and must never be committed. SHA1 2F:23:50:65:...:12:70 is the key Google
# has on file for com.evanevoo.scanifiedandroid; losing it costs a 48-hour
# upload-key reset with Play support.
credentials.json
*.jks
